@startuml
!include theme.puml
' ============ 用例图模板 ============
' 语法提示：actor 角色  usecase 用例  rectangle 系统边界
' 关系：--> 关联    ..> <<include>> 包含    ..> <<extend>> 扩展
' 布局建议：actor 数量控制在 3 个以内，线不容易绕

left to right direction

actor 顾客 as C
actor 管理员 as A

rectangle 电商系统 {
  usecase "浏览商品" as UC1
  usecase "提交订单" as UC2
  usecase "支付" as UC3
  usecase "管理库存" as UC4
  usecase "查看推荐" as UC5
}

C --> UC1
C --> UC2
A --> UC4
UC2 ..> UC3 : <<include>>
UC5 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>

@enduml
